    "title": "Pennsylvania debates radar use for local police forces - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andy Mehalshick ,\n6 hours ago (WBRE/WYOU) — A renewed effort is underway in Harrisburg that would allow local police departments to use radar for speed enforcement. Pennsylvania is the only state in the nation where municipal police departments can not use radar. Right now, only the Pennsylvania State Police can utilize radar. Senate Bill... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
